  "description": "A Humanoid that fails a Wisdom save is Charmed and bears a spectral crown. Before moving on each turn, it must use its action to make a melee attack against a creature you choose if one is in reach; otherwise it acts normally. It repeats the save at each turn\u0027s end. On later turns, you must use a Magic action to maintain the spell.",
